# Keep the non-redeemable QR used by the merchant reward-email previews.
!apps/web-app/public/email-demo-qr.png
# Assets used by the public marketing website must be included in deployments.
!apps/landing-page/public/images/*.png
!apps/landing-page/public/images/*.webp
!apps/landing-page/public/images/blog/*.webp
# Include nested guide screenshots and future public marketing image folders.
!apps/landing-page/public/images/**/*.png
!apps/landing-page/public/images/**/*.jpg
!apps/landing-page/public/images/**/*.jpeg
!apps/landing-page/public/images/**/*.webp
# The *.png exclusion also matches directory names: keep the static OG route.
!apps/landing-page/src/app/og-image.png
!apps/landing-page/src/app/og-image.png/**
# Keep every raster asset used by the Halloween wheel, including SVG image references.
!apps/web-app/public/images/templates/halloween-gold/*.webp
# Keep the production backgrounds and scratch textures used by the beauty scratch templates.
!apps/web-app/public/images/scratch-templates/*.webp
# Native Rose poudré wheel artwork must also be packaged on Vercel.
!apps/web-app/public/images/wheel-templates/beauty-rose-satin.webp
# Beauty Pop artwork and its lightweight library thumbnail.
!apps/web-app/public/images/wheel-templates/beauty-pop-ribbons*.webp
# Seasonal wheel artwork and library thumbnails.
!apps/web-app/public/images/wheel-templates/christmas-*.webp
# Keep the production asset required by the Elegance poster preview and PNG.
!apps/web-app/public/backgrounds/premium-poster-backdrop.png
# Keep the production asset required by the Botanique poster preview and PNG.
!apps/web-app/public/backgrounds/botanical-poster-backdrop.png
